   558	/// This will call the `vt` function on type T with the following signature:
   559	///
   560	///   fn(comptime action: Action.Key, value: Action.Value(action)) void
   561	///
   562	/// The handler type T can choose to react to whatever actions it cares
   563	/// about in its pursuit of implementing a terminal emulator or other
   564	/// functionality.
